    <preface>
      <p>Export Finance and Insurance Corporation Amendment (Equity Investments and Other Measures) Act 2021</p>
      <p>No. 114, 2021</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Export Finance and Insurance Corporation Act 1991</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Equity investments	3</p>
